      "y": 440
    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "3f9b66d2b2406328e64e6b966b190fcb08135dfce505737aa2f91af93380acd8",
      "text": "OWNER-APPROVED, NOT COMPILED\nOVERLAY.IC.COMMON_HUMANITY_MUTUAL_HEALING\nConnect common humanity with mutual peer healing\n\nCommon-humanity guidance is not optional: the person is not alone in suffering, and connection with others who are healing can support mutual peer healing. This must not minimize the person's particular trauma.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 12600,
      "y": 440
    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "400e8fa3121456c6d16ffea5cc61e63c83ef0d895397103dc3e01c201cfba5f2",
      "text": "OWNER-APPROVED, NOT COMPILED\nOVERLAY.IC.TENTATIVE_CONCLUSIONS_REEVALUATE\nRe-evaluate tentative activated conclusions when calm\n\nTentative conclusions are allowed during activation when they create no safety issue, and must be re-evaluated when calm.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 12600,
      "y": 1760
    },
    {
      "file": "current/nodes/inner-child-directed-graph/IC.IDENTITY_FORMATION.md",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "45058a21b6c292a0222a259cd019ddd4bb7a7e10768f1478254cd291f271432e",
      "type": "file",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 1760,
      "y": 0
    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "52ff0b3f131b19801cc8645450589a96c597a17bb109699f877926dc8d7b2c45",
      "text": "OWNER-APPROVED, NOT COMPILED\nOVERLAY.IC.PAUSE_ORIENT_BEFORE_INTERPRETATION\nPause and orient before interpretation\n\nWhen activation is high, pause and orient before deciding what it means. Use a proportionate pause rather than a fixed breath count.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 12600,
      "y": 1540
    },
    {
      "file": "current/nodes/somatic-directed-graph/SOM.MEANING_INTEGRATION.md",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "53a9ddb7f819388accd5566867c8c75ed46d2b49d317719666f40c6ad7e41879",
      "type": "file",
