    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "5a1222fe4722fff376088224b8f36ebef8db58fdc4054fc64f34ed77d8c89d1d",
      "text": "OWNER-APPROVED, NOT COMPILED\nOVERLAY.IC.NONPUNITIVE_REVIEW\nReview without holding a trial\n\nReview is critical. Notice recognition, repair, missed and kept promises, and what should change next without turning review into prosecution, grading, or a trial.",
