      "color": "3",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "b0cb7ee50f0940c67faccade2f7bb44239999e45e4d1a462d37f7f1532d15368",
      "text": "OWNER-APPROVED, NOT COMPILED\nOVERLAY.IC.BEST_FRIEND_REALITY_CHECK\nReality-check borrowed best-friend advice\n\nTreat best-friend advice as a draft and retain only what is compassionate, feasible, value-consistent, and compatible with the person's own judgment.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 12600,
      "y": 0
    },
    {
      "file": "current/nodes/inner-child-directed-graph/IC.AGE_RESPONSIBILITY_CLARIFICATION.md",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "b7ceeb009ad5f3b4952e96d25c9494a01fa8b280a1cddaf3ed4f3c207b45954c",
      "type": "file",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 880,
      "y": 1100
    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "b86c59ec494fa29e2aa7a03366c78316439fa76f3314fbff878067a216e7ceba",
      "text": "OWNER-APPROVED, NOT COMPILED\nOVERLAY.IC.FLEXIBLE_DELIBERATE_CLOSURE\nClose inner work deliberately and flexibly\n\nWhen possible, close inner work deliberately by reorienting, noticing the body, and naming the next ordinary action; do not impose a fixed ritual.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 12600,
      "y": 880
    },
