    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "cc14557bdeea8b7f98c6a540acba70400a7783f4d7be94f3f1439c8f318d7a87",
      "text": "OWNER-APPROVED, NOT COMPILED\nOVERLAY.IC.IDENTITY_BEFORE_DECONSTRUCTION\nDevelop enough identity before deconstructive practice when needed\n\nSome people whose identity is underdeveloped may need preference and selfhood development before no-self or surrender practices are useful. This is not a universal prerequisite.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 12600,
      "y": 1100
    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "cdfbaa43da9f7124e0981d994eeb5fa2b12564a26d2eaee66dbcd01b6baf208f",
      "text": "OWNER-APPROVED, NOT COMPILED\nOVERLAY.IC.WORTH_CAPACITY_DISTINCTION\nSeparate intrinsic worth from developed adult capacity\n\nWorth is intrinsic. Adult capacities such as pausing, protecting, choosing, repairing, differentiating, and acting consistently develop through practice.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 12600,
      "y": 2420
    },
    {
      "file": "current/nodes/inner-child-directed-graph/IC.NEUTRAL_WITNESS.md",
