    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "f0339fbe47bdbfff70d0ea1366549bb6b8c725d2913998699a62ff629981b1db",
      "text": "OWNER-APPROVED, NOT COMPILED\nOVERLAY.IC.BOUNDED_TRUTHFUL_VOW\nMake a bounded truthful protection-and-repair promise\n\nPrefer truthful, bounded promises of protection and repair. After a lapse, return and repair rather than promising invulnerability.",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 12600,
      "y": 220
    },
