      "height": 140,
      "id": "faa94f5e35056a541e8d5671b0efc175d99cee245f4f9a1d9e35231f266d2835",
      "text": "OWNER-APPROVED, NOT COMPILED\nOVERLAY.IC.TRANSITIONS_AND_ENDINGS\nName transitions, endings, and the uncertain gap\n\nDuring a meaningful transition or ending, name what ended, what remains unknown, and how adult and child remain together through the gap without forcing premature certainty.",
      "type": "text",
